Moneys in the Fund shall be applied

(a) towards the basic material support of victims of domestic violence;

(b) for training the families of victims, families and care supporters of victims of domestic violence;

(c) for any matter connected with the rescue rehabilitation and reintegration of victims of domestic violence;
(d) towards the construction of shelters for victims of domestic violence in all the regions and districts;
